**Markdown Syntax**
1. # to ###### : Headings (number of hashes = Level, H1 to H6
2. **text** : Bold
3. *text* / _text_ : Italic
4. - / * / + plus a space: Bullet List 
5. 1. Numbered List
6. [Text] (URL) : Link
7. ![alt](url) : Image
8. 'code' : Inline Code 
9. ''' : Code Block
10. > : Block Quote
11. | : Table Column Separator
12. |---| : Table Head Separator
13. --- / *** / --- :  Horizontal Rule 
14. - [] * : Checkbox
15. ~~text~~ * : Strikethrough
